<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;"><%= provider %> was connected to your account</h1>
  <p>
    A <%= provider %> account can now sign in to <strong><%= user.email %></strong>.
  </p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">
    If that was you, there is nothing to do. If it wasn't, disconnect it and
    reset your password: someone else can sign in as you.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= identities_url %>"
       style="background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
      Review connected accounts
    </a>
  </p>
</div>
